<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on French Matif.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on French Matif.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 300 million American-style call and put warrants in six equal tranches on the French Matif notionnel contract, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.JAN.97-24.FEB.98   PAYDATE	20.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  130.38 PCT</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE	 ISSUE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  132.06 PCT   3.33 FFR   3.84 PCT    3.9 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	  129.06 PCT   4.83 FFR   2.69 PCT    2.7 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	  126.06 PCT   6.77 FFR   1.88 PCT    1.9 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT D	  130.06 PCT   4.16 FFR  -3.44 PCT    3.1 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT E	  127.06 PCT   2.66 FFR  -4.59 PCT    4.9 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT F	  124.06 PCT   1.72 FFR  -6.17 PCT    7.6 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
